{"ok":true,"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00115","versions":[{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00115@rel:R25-11#94709035","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00115","release":"R25-11","content":"function OpenFileWriteOnly [SWS_PER_00115] Upstream: RS_PER_00001 , RS_PER_00004 , RS_PER_00010 , RS_AP_00119 , RS_AP_00120 , RS_AP_00121 , RS_AP_00127 , RS_AP_00128 , RS_AP_00129 , RS_AP_00135 , RS_AP_00139 , RS_AP_00144 , RS_AP_00159 ara::core::Result &lt; UniqueHandle &lt; WriteAccessor &gt; &gt; OpenFileWriteOnly ( ara::core::StringView fileName, OpenMode mode) noexcept; Opens a file of this File Storage for writing with a defined mode. If not otherwise specified by the provided mode, the file is truncated (corresponding to k Truncate). If the file does not exist, it is created. The file will be closed when the returned UniqueHandle goes out of scope. Header-Datei #include \"ara/per/file_storage.h\" class mono Scope class ara::per::FileStorage class mono Exception-Sicherheit exception safe class mono Thread-Sicherheit thread-safe PerErrc ::kIllegalWrite rollback_semantics class mono Parameter (in) th Parameter th Beschreibung td fileName td File name of the file. May correspond to the PersistencyFile.file Name of a configured file. td mode td Mode with which the file shall be opened. Rückgabewert th Typ th Beschreibung td ara::core::Result &lt; UniqueHandle &lt; WriteAccessor &gt; &gt; td A Result containing a UniqueHandle for the file. In case of an error, it contains any of the errors defined below, or a vendor specific error. Fehler th Fehlercode th Beschreibung td Access td Returned if the File Storage is configured as read-only, or if it is configured as write-only-once and the key already exists. td PerErrc ::kPhysicalStorageFailure td no_rollback_semantics Returned if access to the physical storage fails. td PerErrc ::kIntegrityCorrupted td rollback_semantics Returned if stored data cannot be read because the structural integrity is corrupted. td PerErrc ::kValidationFailed td rollback_semantics Returned if the validity of stored data cannot be ensured. td PerErrc ::kEncryptionFailed td rollback_semantics Returned if the decryption of stored data fails. td PerErrc ::kResourceBusy td rollback_semantics Returned if the file is already open, or if DeleteFile, RecoverFile, or ResetFile with the same file name is currently being executed. td PerErrc ::kOutOfStorageSpace td no_rollback_semantics Returned if the available physical storage space is insufficient for a new file. td PerErrc ::kInvalidOpenMode td rollback_semantics Returned if the passed mode contains an invalid combination of modes. td PerErrc ::kTooManyFiles td rollback_semantics Returned if the number of files would get larger than the configured maxNumberOfFiles when the file is created. td PerErrc ::kAuthenticationFailed td rollback_semantics Returned if checking the MAC of stored data fails.","meta":{"trigger_kind":"baseline_sync"},"recorded_at":"2026-09-30T16:43:34+00:00"}],"lifecycle":{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00115","is_dropped":false,"first_active_release":"R25-11","last_active_release":"R25-11","dropped_in":[],"first_dropped_release":null,"absent_before":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11"],"platform_releases":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"latest_platform_release":"R25-11"},"element":{"kind":"function","name":"OpenFileWriteOnly","module":"PER","cluster":"","page":"classes/cl_ara_per_FileStorage_29266b.html","doc_type":"SWS","ai":false,"first":"R25-11","last":"R25-11","changed":[],"distinct":1},"evidence":{"figures":[{"id":"FIG-0cace8c1a26f6582","doc":"AUTOSAR_AP_EXP_SWArchitecture","p":229,"rel":[],"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"Sequence shows OpenFileWriteOnly call.","n":5,"cap":"Figure 11.12: Scenario: Store Persistent Data in File","sha":"0cace8c1a26f6582ad5a46de09f77ad02e41e21a0fa841d0aeaeb81879806a2f","nser":3,"src":"fi